<title>BRAZIL: TENNIS-BRAZIL BEAT AUSTRIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BRAZIL BEAT AUSTRIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Austria 4-1 in their Davis Cup tennis World group qualifier on Sunday after being awarded the two reverse singles when Austria declined to play.</p>
</text>
